{"seq":3,"slug":"online-experimentation","title":"在线实验与 A/B 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-system-engineering/online-experimentation","wordCount":900,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"在线实验与-a-b-测试\">在线实验与 A/B 测试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在线实验（Online Experimentation）是推荐系统验证算法改进效果的金标准。A/B 测试将用户随机分为实验组和对照组，通过比较两组的在线指标差异来判断新策略是否有效。在线实验直接反映真实用户的行为反馈，是离线评估无法替代的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    TRAFFIC[总流量] --&gt; HASH[用户哈希分流]&#10;    HASH --&gt; CONTROL[对照组 50%]&#10;    HASH --&gt; TREATMENT[实验组 50%]&#10;    CONTROL --&gt; OLD[旧策略]&#10;    TREATMENT --&gt; NEW[新策略]&#10;    OLD --&gt; METRICS_C[指标采集]&#10;    NEW --&gt; METRICS_T[指标采集]&#10;    METRICS_C --&gt; COMPARE[统计比较]&#10;    METRICS_T --&gt; COMPARE&#10;    COMPARE --&gt; DECISION[决策]\">graph TB\n    TRAFFIC[总流量] --&gt; HASH[用户哈希分流]\n    HASH --&gt; CONTROL[对照组 50%]\n    HASH --&gt; TREATMENT[实验组 50%]\n    CONTROL --&gt; OLD[旧策略]\n    TREATMENT --&gt; NEW[新策略]\n    OLD --&gt; METRICS_C[指标采集]\n    NEW --&gt; METRICS_T[指标采集]\n    METRICS_C --&gt; COMPARE[统计比较]\n    METRICS_T --&gt; COMPARE\n    COMPARE --&gt; DECISION[决策]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实验类型</th>\n<th>分流方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>灵敏度</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准 A/B</td>\n<td>用户级随机分流</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A/A 测试</td>\n<td>相同策略分流</td>\n<td>验证分流正确性</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多变量测试</td>\n<td>多因素正交分流</td>\n<td>多因素同时测试</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层实验</td>\n<td>流量分层正交</td>\n<td>同时运行多个实验</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Interleaving</td>\n<td>结果交错展示</td>\n<td>排序比较</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实验设计与分流\">实验设计与分流</h2><p>正确的实验设计是在线实验可靠性的基础。关键设计要素包括分流策略、样本量计算和实验时长。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ExperimentConfig {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  hypothesis: string;&#10;  primaryMetric: string;&#10;  guardrailMetrics: string[];&#10;  trafficPercent: number;&#10;  hashSalt: string;&#10;  startDate: Date;&#10;  endDate: Date;&#10;  minSampleSize: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ExperimentResult {&#10;  controlMetrics: MetricResult;&#10;  treatmentMetrics: MetricResult;&#10;  uplift: number;&#10;  pValue: number;&#10;  confidenceInterval: [number, number];&#10;  powerAchieved: number;&#10;  decision: &#39;ship&#39; | &#39;iterate&#39; | &#39;reject&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface MetricResult {&#10;  mean: number;&#10;  variance: number;&#10;  sampleSize: number;&#10;  confidence95: [number, number];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function userBucketAssignment(userId: string, experimentId: string, salt: string, numBuckets: number = 1000): number {&#10;  const hash = murmurhash(`${userId}:${experimentId}:${salt}`);&#10;  return hash % numBuckets;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculateRequiredSampleSize(&#10;  baselineMetric: number,&#10;  expectedUplift: number,&#10;  alpha: number = 0.05,&#10;  beta: number = 0.2,&#10;): number {&#10;  const delta = baselineMetric * expectedUplift;&#10;  const variance = baselineMetric * (1 - baselineMetric);&#10;  const zAlpha = 1.96;&#10;  const zBeta = 0.84;&#10;  return Math.ceil((2 * variance * (zAlpha + zBeta) ** 2) / delta ** 2);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExperimentConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><